{
    "title": "\u06af\u0647\u0648\u0627\u0631\u0647 \u062a\u0631\u0628\u06cc\u062a \u06a9\u0648\u062f\u06a9 \u0648 \u0628\u0627\u0631\u062f\u0627\u0631\u06cc",
    "description": "Imagine that in the winding path of pregnancy and parenting, there is a guide that is just a touch away from you!\r\n\r\nThe cradle is by your side to provide you with scientific content and special tools in the field of health, care and education of your child, according to the week of pregnancy and the age of your child.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are pregnant:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Week by week pregnancy tools: You can see every week with a picture what stage of development your fetus is in and which parts of its body are being formed. You can also recognize the natural changes in your body.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Daily consultant's message: The consultant's message will send you scientific tips and necessary care every day according to the week and stage of your pregnancy.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Pregnancy care tools: based on the week of pregnancy, you can find out which ultrasounds and tests you should do, how you should prepare for them and interpret their results.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Name selection tool: Still haven't chosen a name for your little one? The name selection tool offers you beautiful names based on your interest\r\n\r\n\u2022 Cooking tools: We have prepared more than one hundred types of healthy and simple recipes for your health and the health of your baby\r\n\r\n\u2022 Pregnancy weight tool: With the weight tool, you can see your healthy weight range and be sure of your health.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Social network: Ask any question to the crib moms, they will answer you in less than 5 minutes!\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you have children:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Growth tool: With this tool, you can see the growth chart of your child's height and weight and monitor his growth process. In addition, with the growth test tool, you can also measure your child's motor, cognitive and emotional growth.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Daily consultant's message: The consultant's message sends you scientific and practical tips about the care and education of your child every day.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sleep tool: any kind of lullaby you can think of, you can find in the sleep tool! From local and wordless lullabies to English lullabies and the warm sound of lullabies sung by cradle mothers.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Feeding tool: You can count on this tool to start all kinds of auxiliary food! You have access to the recipes of hundreds of types of complementary foods suitable for your child's age and food allergy monitoring tools\r\n\r\n\u2022 Vaccine tool: It reminds you of the time of vaccinations and also explains scientific solutions to take care of your child after vaccination.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Game tools: If you don't know what games are suitable for your child's age and help to develop his mental and physical strength, the bank of cradle games is your crutch.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Social network: Ask any question to the crib moms, they will answer you in less than 5 minutes!\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is not the whole story, Ghawarah is always trying to provide up-to-date educational tools and content according to your needs. Be with us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Imagine that in the winding path of pregnancy and parenting, there is a guide that is just a touch away from you!<br><br>The cradle is by your side to provide you with scientific content and special tools in the field of health, care and education of your child, according to the week of pregnancy and the age of your child.<br><br><br>If you are pregnant:<br><br>\u2022 Week by week pregnancy tools: You can see every week with a picture what stage of development your fetus is in and which parts of its body are being formed. You can also recognize the natural changes in your body.<br><br>\u2022 Daily consultant&#39;s message: The consultant&#39;s message will send you scientific tips and necessary care every day according to the week and stage of your pregnancy.<br><br>\u2022 Pregnancy care tools: based on the week of pregnancy, you can find out which ultrasounds and tests you should do, how you should prepare for them and interpret their results.<br><br>\u2022 Name selection tool: Still haven&#39;t chosen a name for your little one? The name selection tool offers you beautiful names based on your interest<br><br>\u2022 Cooking tools: We have prepared more than one hundred types of healthy and simple recipes for your health and the health of your baby<br><br>\u2022 Pregnancy weight tool: With the weight tool, you can see your healthy weight range and be sure of your health.<br><br>\u2022 Social network: Ask any question to the crib moms, they will answer you in less than 5 minutes!<br><br><br>If you have children:<br><br>\u2022 Growth tool: With this tool, you can see the growth chart of your child&#39;s height and weight and monitor his growth process. In addition, with the growth test tool, you can also measure your child&#39;s motor, cognitive and emotional growth.<br><br>\u2022 Daily consultant&#39;s message: The consultant&#39;s message sends you scientific and practical tips about the care and education of your child every day.<br><br>\u2022 Sleep tool: any kind of lullaby you can think of, you can find in the sleep tool! From local and wordless lullabies to English lullabies and the warm sound of lullabies sung by cradle mothers.<br><br>\u2022 Feeding tool: You can count on this tool to start all kinds of auxiliary food! You have access to the recipes of hundreds of types of complementary foods suitable for your child&#39;s age and food allergy monitoring tools<br><br>\u2022 Vaccine tool: It reminds you of the time of vaccinations and also explains scientific solutions to take care of your child after vaccination.<br><br>\u2022 Game tools: If you don&#39;t know what games are suitable for your child&#39;s age and help to develop his mental and physical strength, the bank of cradle games is your crutch.<br><br>\u2022 Social network: Ask any question to the crib moms, they will answer you in less than 5 minutes!<br><br><br>This is not the whole story, Ghawarah is always trying to provide up-to-date educational tools and content according to your needs. Be with us.",
